{"page":"SMARCD2","gene":"SMARCD2","accession":"Q92925","protein":"SWI/SNF-related matrix-associated actin-dependent regulator of chromatin subfamily D member 2","length":531,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"Q92925-1","name":"1","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000448276.7"],"refseq":["NM_001098426.2"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001091896.1"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q92925-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q92925-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":76.2,"plddt":[[0,11],[50,1],[0,15],[50,1],[0,2],[50,1],[0,15],[50,1],[0,48],[50,1],[0,40],[50,4],[70,14],[90,29],[70,7],[90,13],[70,2],[50,2],[0,1],[50,1],[0,13],[50,4],[70,1],[90,12],[70,2],[50,4],[70,2],[90,18],[70,3],[90,9],[70,1],[90,13],[70,2],[90,13],[70,1],[90,87],[70,5],[50,2],[70,1],[90,9],[70,7],[90,6],[70,6],[90,53],[70,8],[90,28],[70,1],[90,1],[70,6],[50,3],[0,1]]}},"features":[{"type":"Modified residue","start":81,"end":81,"description":"Asymmetric dimethylarginine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":104,"end":104,"description":"Asymmetric dimethylarginine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":203,"end":203,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":217,"end":217,"description":"Phosphothreonine"},{"type":"Cross-link","start":226,"end":226,"description":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in SUMO2)"},{"type":"Domain","start":306,"end":383,"description":"SWIB/MDM2"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Component of the multiprotein chromatin-remodeling complexes SWI/SNF: SWI/SNF-A (BAF), SWI/SNF-B (PBAF) and related complexes. The canonical complex contains a catalytic subunit (either SMARCA4/BRG1/BAF190A or SMARCA2/BRM/BAF190B), and at least SMARCE1, ACTL6A/BAF53, SMARCC1/BAF155, SMARCC2/BAF170, and SMARCB1/SNF5/BAF47. Other subunits specific to each of the complexes may also be present permitting several possible combinations developmentally and tissue specific (PubMed:22952240). Component of the BAF complex, which includes at least actin (ACTB), ARID1A/BAF250A, ARID1B/BAF250B, SMARCA2/BRM, SMARCA4/BRG1, ACTL6A/BAF53, ACTL6B/BAF53B, SMARCE1/BAF57, SMARCC1/BAF155, SMARCC2/BAF170, SMARCB1/SNF5/INI1, and one or more SMARCD1/BAF60A, SMARCD2/BAF60B, or SMARCD3/BAF60C (PubMed:18765789). In muscle cells, the BAF complex also contains DPF3. Component of the SWI/SNF-B (PBAF) chromatin remodeling complex, at least composed of SMARCA4/BRG1, SMARCB1/BAF47/SNF5, ACTL6A/BAF53A or ACTL6B/BAF53B, SMARCE1/BAF57, SMARCD1/BAF60A, SMARCD2/BAF60B, perhaps SMARCD3/BAF60C, SMARCC1/BAF155, SMARCC2/BAF170, PBRM1/BAF180, ARID2/BAF200 and actin (ACTB) (PubMed:22952240, PubMed:26601204). Interacts with UNKL (PubMed:20148946). Interacts with CEBPE (PubMed:28369036)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q92925-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[{"topic":"Miscellaneous","text":"Produced by aberrant splicing sites"}],"length":510,"transcripts":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,47],[48,69,17],[103,124,408]],"edits":[{"start":48,"end":68,"original":"AGGVGGPGAAAFRPMGPAGPA","replacement":"","added":0},{"start":86,"end":123,"original":"GLQVGPPAGSPFGAAAPLRPGMPPTMMDPFRKRLLVPQ","replacement":"RLAGGTPCWLPIWCSSSASTWHPTHHDGSIPKTPACAP","added":38}],"missing":21,"replaced":38,"novel":38,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[[1,0,1]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q92925-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q92925-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":77.6,"plddt":[[0,11],[50,1],[0,2],[50,1],[0,12],[50,1],[0,1],[50,2],[0,84],[50,4],[70,8],[90,1],[70,3],[90,1],[70,1],[90,29],[70,7],[90,13],[70,2],[50,2],[0,1],[50,1],[0,14],[50,2],[70,2],[90,12],[70,2],[50,4],[70,2],[90,18],[70,3],[90,9],[70,1],[90,13],[70,2],[90,13],[70,1],[90,87],[70,5],[50,2],[70,2],[90,8],[70,8],[90,5],[70,6],[90,53],[70,8],[90,30],[70,6],[50,3],[0,1]],"losingConfidence":0}},{"accession":"Q92925